The [[Tower of Karazhan]] raid has two separate attunement questlines. Gaining entry to the upper reaches of the tower requires the [[Upper Karazhan Tower Key]], which grants access to the first five bosses of the raid. However, [[the Scepter of Medivh]] is required to access the last four bosses of the raid.

